          "homepage": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/series/GW4HM7WP9/senpai-is-an-otokonoko",
          "overview": "During spring break, Saki visits her father and has a close encounter with a whale. / Makoto confronts a former classmate. Meanwhile, Saki must make a difficult decision. / Saki is upset after spending the day at her mother's house. Makoto, meanwhile, decides to take a step forward. / After much thought, Saki finally makes a decision.",
